  "summary": "You get two lists of integers, `nums1` and `nums2`, each sorted from smallest to largest. Return the median of all their numbers taken together: the middle number once they're merged in order, or the average of the two middle numbers when the total count is even. The search must run in O(log(m + n)) time, where m and n are the lengths of the lists.",
